      ],
      "en": "The king answered them roughly; and King Rehoboam abandoned the counsel of the old men,",
      "ko": "왕이 포학한 말로 대답할쌔 노인의 교도를 버리고",
      "source_text_hash": "e0d92f40eb4f63126a99081088ac7e7fa007eb1cd0ef828f559721b458c33421",
